This is NOT a git patch file. It is a human-readable manifest of a build-config
pin that lives in `overrides/bun.lock` (bun's lockfile). The OP7 CI copies
`overrides/bun.lock` into the upstream mirror and runs `bun install
--frozen-lockfile`, which installs @siteed/audio-studio@3.0.3.

Reason: @siteed/audio-studio@3.0.4+ overrides Promise.reject(code: String?, ...)
which is a compile error against expo-modules-core (reject(String, ...)).
Upstream patch-package patches are authored against 3.0.3.

If upstream ever updates the patch-package patches to match a newer siteed,
regenerate overrides/bun.lock from the upstream tree (with that siteed version)
and remove this note.
